# Trivy findings accepted on purpose. CI fails on any fixable HIGH or CRITICAL
# vulnerability in the Docker image (.github/workflows/ci.yml) unless it is
# listed here.
#
# One ID per line, each with a comment saying why it is accepted and when to
# look at it again. For example:
#
#   # Not reachable: K8Board never calls <function>. Review by 2027-01-31.
#   CVE-2026-00000
#
# Prefer a fix (bump the base image digest or the dependency) over an entry.
